## Overview As the product suite grew across mobile and web platforms, visual

inconsistency and engineering rework were compounding. We established
**Canvas**: a systematic foundation comprising atomic design tokens, accessible
components, and comprehensive design guidelines. ## Results - Decreased frontend
design QA cycles by **50%**. - 100% WCAG 2.1 AA compliance across all
foundational components. - Direct Figma-to-Code sync via automated GitHub
Actions tokens.
